{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01EB4WbdTtKd6airKPWj9fTi","type":"tool_result","content":"=== SOS 1 ===\n{\n  \"name\": \"The Dawning Archaic\",\n  \"mana_cost\": \"{10}\",\n  \"type_line\": \"Legendary Creature — Avatar\",\n  \"oracle_text\": \"This spell costs {1} less to cast for each instant and sorcery card in your graveyard.\\nReach\\nWhenever The Dawning Archaic attacks, you may cast target instant or sorcery card from your graveyard without paying its mana cost. If that spell would be put into your graveyard, exile it instead.\",\n  \"power\": \"7\",\n  \"toughness\": \"7\",\n  \"loyalty\": null,\n  \"colors\": [],\n  \"keywords\": [\n    \"Reach\"\n  ],\n  \"rarity\": \"mythic\",\n  \"set_code\": \"sos\",\n  \"collector_number\": \"1\",\n  \"complexity_tier\": \"complex\"\n}\n\n=== SOS 4 ===\n{\n  \"name\": \"Together as One\",\n  \"mana_cost\": \"{6}\",\n  \"type_line\": \"Sorcery\",\n  \"oracle_text\": \"Converge — Target player draws X cards, Together as One deals X damage to any target, and you gain X life, where X is the number of colors of mana spent to cast this spell.\",\n  \"power\": null,\n  \"toughness\": null,\n  \"loyalty\": null,\n  \"colors\": [],\n  \"keywords\": [\n    \"Converge\"\n  ],\n  \"rarity\": \"rare\",\n  \"set_code\": \"sos\",\n  \"collector_number\": \"4\",\n  \"complexity_tier\": \"complex\"\n}\n\n=== SOS 13 ===\n{\n  \"name\": \"Emeritus of Truce // Swords to Plowshares\",\n  \"mana_cost\": \"{1}{W}{W} // {W}\",\n  \"type_line\": \"Creature — Cat Cleric // Instant\",\n  \"oracle_text\": \"When this creature enters, target player creates a 1/1 white and black Inkling creature token with flying. Then if an opponent controls more creatures than you, this creature becomes prepared. (While it's prepared, you may cast a copy of its spell. Doing so unprepares it.)\",\n  \"power\": \"3\",\n  \"toughness\": \"3\",\n  \"loyalty\": null,\n  \"colors\": [\n    \"W\"\n  ],\n  \"keywords\": [\n    \"