{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-4-6","id":"msg_0145WYCwDdtJn1KaKzcUeXD4","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I now have enough understanding to start implementing. Let me create KEY_DECISIONS.md and begin with the engine changes E1, E2, E3."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1068,"cache_read_input_tokens":89754,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1068},"output_tokens":30,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"8a32b7f0-be82-4ad8-afb4-a624c81177bb","uuid":"47008c45-d435-43d8-8d87-be91600f3561","request_id":"req_011CbwJeePkHgpRKSn2oj9PQ"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-4-6","id":"msg_0145WYCwDdtJn1KaKzcUeXD4","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01C8hHxttr2hcsEJ1QCGbSSf","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/workspace/KEY_DECISIONS.md","content":"# KEY_DECISIONS.md — Deviation and Ambiguity Log\n\n## E2 — BeginningOfPrecombatMainTriggeredEvent\n**Decision**: Fired from `GameState.advance_phase` after `empty_mana_pools()` when `self.phase == Phase.PRECOMBAT_MAIN`. This means it fires whenever the engine transitions INTO PRECOMBAT_MAIN, whether via `run_turn` or via `advance_to_phase` directly.\n\n## E3 — Battlefield cost-reduction aggregation\n**Decision**: Only applies when the spell being cast is an instant or sorcery (CardType.INSTANT or CardType.SORCERY), per the spec requirement for affinity permanents granting instant/sorcery cost reduction.\n\n## sos_257 — Restricted mana implementation\n**Decision**: Added `_restricted: dict[ManaType, int]` to ManaPool and optional `for_instant_sorcery=False` parameter to `can_pay`/`pay`. The casting pipeline detects instant/sorcery and passes `for_instant_sorcery=True`. Restriction is a deliberate card-local limitation (not a general \"restricted mana\" subsystem) — only Great Hall produces restricted mana.\n\n## sos_13 — SwordsToPlowshares exile-instead-of-graveyard for prepared copy\n**Decision**: When the prepared Swords to Plowshares copy is cast free from exile, it starts in exile (not a zone other than exile) so the exile-instead replacement effect for sos_1 does not apply here. The copy naturally resolves from exile — if it would go to the graveyard after resolving, it goes to the graveyard (it was just a copy, already originated from exile). Prepared mechanic: implemented as a `_prepared` flag on the creature; casting the copy clears the flag.\n\n## sos_201 — Miracle cost\n**Decision**: \"Miracle {2}\" means the miracle cost is {2} (generic only), not {2} plus any colored pips. To cast at miracle cost, subtract the normal mana cost and apply {2} instead. Since the engine doesn't support true alternative-cost substitution, implementation uses the cost-reduction hook: card's full cost minus 2 is reduced (clamped so the net is {2}). For simplicity, miracle is implemented by directly adding the card to the stack via cast_spell_free with a {2} deduction from mana pool.\n\n## sos_97 — game.rng\n**Decision**: Added `rng: random.Random` attribute to GameState if absent. Cards that need deterministic coin flips use `game.rng.randint(0, 1)` with a seeded RNG in tests via `game.rng.seed(...)`.\n\n## sos_97 — skip_turns\n**Decision**: Added `skip_turns: int = 0` attribute to Player. The `run_turn` function checks and decrements `skip_turns` to implement turn-skipping. This is additive (new attribute on Player, new check in run_turn).\n\n## sos_120 — Paradigm copy casting\n**Decision**: Paradigm registers a recurring BeginningOfPrecombatMainTriggeredEvent trigger on the exiled card object itself (with no unregister). The trigger fires every precombat main and offers a copy cast. Using copy_spell on a StackObject constructed from the exiled card.\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1068,"cache_read_input_tokens":89754,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1068},"output_tokens":30,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"8a32b7f0-be82-4ad8-afb4-a624c81177bb","uuid":"f9390007-c0bd-442c-a431-4efe5df62a38","request_id":"req_011CbwJeePkHgpRKSn2oj9PQ"}
