._last_payment_colors: list[Color] = []\n     \n     def add_restricted(self, mana_type: ManaType, amount: int = 1) -> None: ...\n     def restricted_total(self) -> int: ...\n     def empty(self) -> None:  # also clears _restricted\n     def can_pay(self, cost: ManaCost, for_instant_sorcery: bool = False) -> bool: ...\n     def pay(self, cost: ManaCost, choices=None, for_instant_sorcery: bool = False) -> bool: ...\n     ```\n     When `for_instant_sorcery=True`: merged pool = `_pool + _restricted`. After payment, drains from `_pool` first, then `_restricted`.\n\n   - `/workspace/engine/zones.py` — Extended `move_to_zone` to apply replacement effects for stack→graveyard moves:\n     ```python\n     from_stack_to_gy = from_zone == Zone.STACK and to_zone == Zone.GRAVEYARD\n     if replacement_event is not None and (leaving_battlefield or from_stack_to_gy):\n         ...\n     ```\n\n   - `/workspace/engine/combat.py` — Added `AttacksTriggeredEvent` firing in `declare_attackers_step`:\n     ```python\n     from engine.events import AttacksTriggeredEvent\n     game.trigger_manager.fire_event(\n         game,\n         AttacksTriggeredEvent(creature=attacker, attacker=attacker),\n     )\n     ```\n\n   - `/workspace/cards/sos/sos_4/card_impl.py` — `TogetherAsOne(Sorcery)`: Converge mechanic; `get_targets` returns two TargetRequirements; `on_resolve` reads `colors_spent`, computes X = len(set(colors_spent)), draws/deals/gains.\n\n   - `/workspace/cards/sos/sos_4/tests.py` — 4 tests: X=0 colorless, X=3 three-color, X=1 single-color, target player draws. All passing.\n\n   - `/workspace/cards/sos/sos_1/card_impl.py` — `TheDawningArchaic(Creature)`:\n     - `cost_reduction`: count instants/sorceries in controller's graveyard\n     - `Keyword.REACH` keyword\n     - `register_triggers`: AttacksTriggeredEvent → find instant/sorcery in graveyard (auto-select if 1), register MoveToGraveyardReplacementEvent to exile instead of graveyard, call `cast_spell_free(..., Zone.GRAVEYARD)`\